{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ca57d3597118a7bbd0419051250264b1d30cc7eb5824d5a6802e07fdfefd816e","ja":"プロデュースに挑戦！","zh":"挑战担任制作人！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b0e5e74d794be94fd404bce25c50ab29ef3f549cccc489867fd80ea1a281cfa7","ja":"TV番組で、歌織が重要な役割を担う企画が始まった。\nそれは歌織がプロデューサーとなり、","zh":"电视节目中，歌织承担重要职责的企划开始了。\n内容是歌织担任制作人，","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1e449e7e9c915f2688b98616e2a8114a183b5b5b6c8019ac8298ec81b60706a7","ja":"アイドル志望の女の子を、\nオーディションまでサポートする、という内容で……","zh":"内容就是支持一名想当偶像的女孩，\n直到她参加试镜为止……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1ec065b4e46e0da0e6a8209e5454a7662818445dce7c434d77376dd352d90a4a","ja":"で、どうプロデュースするんだ？　あたしとレイは\nカオリのサポート役だから、なんでも言ってくれよな。","zh":"那，该怎么进行制作呢？我和丽\n是歌织的支援角色，有什么事尽管说。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2bd0747456e1cd50052a0a5ab65bac32aa6f9cf4f1947fd74a9f6827d92b0fc4","ja":"それなんだけど……\n今からでも断った方がいいか、迷ってて……。","zh":"就是那件事……\n我在犹豫，现在是不是该拒绝比较好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"913a4e9fc05020bccfe3256dd4a7ebe4b39b834e91cde12e793c4b97d52751ff","ja":"何か気になることでもあるんですか？","zh":"有什么在意的事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7e41250e75d77c6eb193cd80d3f4bc15fce10a96d302d403b9fe5c48ef02f58d","ja":"やっぱり不安で……だって、\n私が誰かをプロデュースするだなんて……。","zh":"果然还是不安……毕竟，\n我居然要培养谁什么的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ed86f958ec31f45064a8d611ecd8a93a65abffd5795a1542c8b4ec8f6c2ab3c8","ja":"オーディションの合否が、\nその子の将来を左右するかもしれないのに……。","zh":"选秀的合格与否，\n说不定会左右那孩子的将来……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b111253c904300fdf6a5c413e5ae3f8e897158656e32b91e3008edb16c4a8351","ja":"確かに、番組で追ってるって言っても、\n審査員には秘密のガチンコ勝負だからな。","zh":"确实，虽说节目会跟拍，  \n但对评委来说是秘密的真刀真枪较量啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e1ab9992783762ab0f29e0175584b28f75f6301d5ddbeda6a4ec55c77d0dd1ae","ja":"不合格になる可能性もみんな一緒だ。\nけど……。","zh":"落选的可能性大家都一样。\n不过……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"fc253edd4c84912b9e3ce9369dcab2027a6fa9ef041077a0014ddda1d3312b27","ja":"歌織さんなら大丈夫ですよ！\n音楽の先生だったんですし……。","zh":"歌织小姐的话，一定没问题！\n毕竟以前还是音乐老师……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"769d4222567860ec6a51a8c3c62c81966300e28291b7be22bf8028e6298adf9d","ja":"それに、この前のプロデューサー役も、\nバッチリだったじゃないですか！","zh":"而且，您上次出演制作人一角时，\n表现不是也很棒吗！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4b2b0078ec7a218bd2c5d5a20697c23283332319fe8f4109c9735a7bd064af68","ja":"そ、それは、ドラマの役だから……。","zh":"那、那是因为我演的是电视剧里的角色……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6d3eea914d5c4c306efe27547e5f3420e086ddd3c225c23cc4483c201002c18b","ja":"けど、カオリが歌のレッスンするだけでも、\n絶対プラスになると思うぜ。","zh":"不过，光是让歌织指导歌唱，\n我觉得也绝对会有所帮助。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"332ca609391a51aea2b4f3e0db565c1226888ff4d88482daad8d8b0f691ca37b","ja":"そうだといいんだけど……。そうね、\nなにか手助けになれるように、頑張るわ！","zh":"要是那样就好了……是啊，\n我会努力，争取能帮上点忙！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"283ffd587868446dbb4528d4c13d0c5f4b61b9966b54529dbcc6ad747f245024","ja":"そして、プロデュースする少女との\n顔合わせ当日……","zh":"然后，与要制作的少女初次见面的\n当天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a4725c23ddc1a9c09e9085f062b4a96db9cf7e1ab4e8b08a3b46831c9a360c91","ja":"「よ、よよ、よろしくお願いします！\nさ、さ、サツキ、です！」","zh":"「请、请请多多关照！\n我、我我叫萨月！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"659b9821aad09454363bb79fbf82602b39595e43851b07e61f9efb8c40198a2a","ja":"「桜守さんたちにプロデュースしてもらえるなんて、\nこ、こ、光栄でひゅっ！」","zh":"「能、能由樱守小姐她们来负责制作，\n真、真、真是我的荣幸！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"0f72613ee1b09de31c578ebb81ec5e96c47fddbb4e468af5ada0fa0354f955d9","ja":"緊張しちゃってるみたいね。\nまずはゆっくり深呼吸して、リラックスしましょう。","zh":"看起来挺紧张的呢。\n先慢慢深呼吸，放松一下吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c7342953535cc99e5ae1e56245902fa481a1594d86f902010ea76cc119fa1d89","ja":"余計な力が入ってると、本来の動きが出来なくて、\nパフォーマンスが落ちてしまうわよ。","zh":"要是身体绷得太紧，就无法做出原本的动作，\n表现也会下降哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"29a2d4eb127048870fa3d8b27c93b9aa6aa81251fe003563a82334b882f51af4","ja":"「は、はひ！　……すー、はー……」","zh":"好、好的！……呼——、哈——……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"844f044247074548a6cc4bb42bf4223f9edae31c17664c8aa4bd0e2e4ebb9976","ja":"その調子だ。緊張することはこれからもあるだろうから\nうまく付き合っていく方法をみつけるといいぜ。","zh":"这样就对了。今后也还会有紧张的时候，\n找个能妥善应对的方法就好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"35fd66262f8f79ed7748a9a86051eda5cff74cdaab014162c2488d2c5d206a0d","ja":"楽しいことを考えるといいかも！\n私はやっぱり登山かな～。ご褒美山登り♪","zh":"想点开心的事情也不错哦！\n我果然还是登山啦～。奖励登山♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"31bcbe063126866df71d2729b6a72088c7f2747f78193dc4cf6ae1d0e74add38","ja":"「……ふふっ。『ご褒美山登り』って、\nあんまり聞かない言葉ですね」","zh":"“……呵呵。‘奖励登山’这个说法，\n倒是不太常听到呢。”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1822.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"a1ef60acb6ab3005bf5097aeb8231715f4992c4e2bb0a1fc24778f433a650780","ja":"いい感じに緊張が解けてきたみたいね。\nそれじゃあ、レッスンを始めましょうか。","zh":"看起来紧张感已经缓解得差不多了呢。\n那么，我们开始课程吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
